# Implementation Plan - Phase 49: Marketing Autopilot Hardening (Market Entry)

## Goal
Operationalize the "Marketing Autopilot" by creating a robust CLI/Daemon (`marketing_autopilot.py`) that manages the Listen-Strategize-Draft-Publish loop. This replaces the manual [cheatsheet.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/.agent/workflows/marketing_autopilot_cheatsheet.md) process and `simulation` scripts.

## User Review Required
- [ ] Confirm if "Market Entry" includes sending the actual Beta emails (I can draft them, but user must send).
- [ ] Confirm if [marketing_log.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/docs/marketing/marketing_log.md) is the single source of truth for "Listener" data.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. New Script: `scripts/marketing_autopilot.py`
- **Class**: `MarketingAutopilot`
- **Commands**:
    - `listen`: (Placeholder/Input) Reads `listening_dump.md` or prompts user to paste content, then structured-logs it to [marketing_log.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/docs/marketing/marketing_log.md).
    - `scout`: Uses `search_web` tool (via LLM) or Perplexity API (if avail) to find trends, logs to [marketing_log.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/docs/marketing/marketing_log.md).
    - `strategize`: Wraps [auto_strategy_sync.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/auto_strategy_sync.py).
    - `draft`: Scans [marketing_log.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/docs/marketing/marketing_log.md) for "New Opportunity", generates drafts using [strategy.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/7c654df4-b83e-43f9-8620-f15868ec39d1/repo_strategy.md) context, appends to `drafts.md`.
    - `publish`: (CLI) Lists pending drafts, allows "Mark as Posted", updates log.
    - `daemon`: Runs the loop every X hours.

### 2. Update [tools/marketing-dashboard/server.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/marketing-dashboard/server.py)
- [ ] Ensure `/api/ingest` writes to [marketing_log.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/docs/marketing/marketing_log.md) in the format `marketing_autopilot.py` expects.

### 3. Documentation
- [ ] Update [marketing_autopilot_cheatsheet.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/.agent/workflows/marketing_autopilot_cheatsheet.md) to point to the new CLI.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `python3 scripts/marketing_autopilot.py --test` (Mock run).

### Manual Verification
1. Run `python3 scripts/marketing_autopilot.py scout` -> Check log.
2. Run `python3 scripts/marketing_autopilot.py draft` -> Check `drafts.md`.
3. Run `python3 scripts/marketing_autopilot.py publish` -> Mark as done.
